{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T07:47:52.315Z","data":{"text":"Task 1 is implemented and its verify passes. Summary:\n\n**Delivered (all in scope)**\n- `src/core/vcs/vcs.ts` — the read-only `Vcs` port (`VcsHead`, `VcsStash`, `VcsStatusEntry`, `Vcs`); no git execution.\n- `src/core/vcs/git-vcs.ts` — `GitVcs` using `execFile` with an argument list, project-root cwd, `GIT_DIR`/`GIT_INDEX_FILE`/`GIT_WORK_TREE` stripped, every call bounded by `timeouts.gitSeconds` (default `10` beside a comment). Reads HEAD commit/branch, SHA-256 of `ls-files --stage -z`, `stash list --format=%H%x00%gs`, and `status --porcelain=v1 -z --untracked-files=all` with rename old-paths.\n- `src/core/vcs/no-vcs.ts` — `NoVcs` with null/empty reads and the reason.\n- `src/core/vcs/select.ts` — `selectVcs`, the only importer of the two implementations; reasons `git not found`, `not a git repository`, `not the repository root` via realpath comparison.\n- `src/core/foundation/config.ts` — one-line optional `timeouts.gitSeconds`.\n- `tests/vcs.test.ts` — 16 tests: every scenario of both requirements against temporary repos, `NoVcs` on `fixture/`, staged-file index change, `-m` stash, rename in status, `GIT_DIR` override, and configured/default timeout.\n\n**Blocker (outside scope, reported in the result)**\n`pnpm verify` is red at HEAD for one reason unrelated to this task: the before-approval step committed `decisions/003-git-strategy.md`, so `tests/decisions-read.test.ts` now reads five ADRs where it asserts four (2147/2148 pass). No task in change 084 owns that file, and changing a preexisting test outside scope would kill the task, so I left it and recorded a `## Blocked` note asking the plan to add that file (with `tests.modify: true`) to a task.\n\nTask verify: `node --import tsx --test tests/vcs.test.ts` → 16/16 pass. Result written to `openspec/changes/084-git-stage-0/.run/results/1.md`."}}
